---
description: Use local Go with go.mod toolchain; do not introduce Node/Bun or Docker for this project.
globs: "*.go, go.mod, go.sum"
alwaysApply: false
---

Default to local Go. Do not use Docker, Bun, Node.js, npm, pnpm, or yarn for this project.

- Pin the Go version with `go` and `toolchain` in `go.mod`
- Use `go run .`, `go test ./...`, `go build`, and `go mod tidy`
- Prefer the standard library before adding third-party modules
- Keep module path updates via `go mod edit -module ...`
